Package: vishare-quick
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ViShare Quick contributors <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ahamviraj/ViShare_Quick
Description: Local Quick Share file transfer for Windows and Linux
 ViShare Quick provides a local-only interface for sending and receiving
 files with Android Quick Share. It uses explicit PIN comparison and file
 consent, and never requires a Google account or cloud relay.
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 | libwebkit2gtk-4.0-37
